{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0018_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_01_title", "source_sha256": "fbf56c4615eaca122144f0905796485c871c95c17521e0155039f103f1c87e5a", "ja": "私たちがリコッタ！", "zh": "我们是『Ricotta』！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0018_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_01_synopsis", "source_sha256": "27d9a3b7713d091d9dfdb1ed9985c0c5ca690e63a8d051a62cd2692b149b972d", "ja": "『リコッタ』というユニットを組むことに\nなった春香、亜利沙、奈緒、のり子、桃子の\n5人。アイドルが大好きな亜利沙は、春香と\n一緒にユニットが組めることに大喜び。春香\nは仲のいいユニットにしていきたいと語る。", "zh": "春香、亚利沙、奈绪、法子、桃子五人，\n组成了叫做『Ricotta』的团体。\n非常喜欢偶像的亚利沙，\n因为可以和春香组成团体非常开心。\n春香则希望可以成为一个感情很好的团体。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0018_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_01_1000_p", "source_sha256": "20671628413df389f5688622c193e24654b9eb0e1c706df12c261f1914c302d6", "ja": "（新たなユニット結成を伝えるため、さっそくメンバー\n5人に集まるよう声をかけた。そろそろ時間だ……）", "zh": "（为了宣布组成新团体的事，我迫不及待找来五位成员。\n差不多要到集合时间了……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0018_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_01_1001_001har", "source_sha256": "7699e744f8d315d8c4ae06234ae4efcbc9ab28408099d7dfbc8cca3dd41d18b5", "ja": "あ、{$P$}さん。\nおはようございます！", "zh": "啊，{$P$}先生。\n早安！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0018_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_01_1002_p", "source_sha256": "e0a80280130932b1f769dfd89301be54b90db571504c01b70ec863f2d85518dd", "ja": "おはよう、春香。\n今朝は春香が一番乗りだな。", "zh": "早啊，春香。\n今天早上是春香第一个到耶。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0018_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_01_1003_001har", "source_sha256": "ae9a7ee3ca9a5d199489eb40fc0919a0b03ad020f2bd2d74cdbbfd400e7707f4", "ja": "はい！　なんだか早く目が覚めちゃって……。\nあの。今日って、新しいお仕事のお話なんですよね？", "zh": "对呀！不知道为什么今天醒得特别早……\n那个，今天是要讲新工作的事情对吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0018_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_01_1004_p", "source_sha256": "543a2ebd69c61034e1ddaa9353752c51b86208b840bd21f951378d1523714e9a", "ja": "ああ、そうだよ。\n他のみんなも、そろそろ来るはずだけど……。", "zh": "嗯，没错。\n其他人应该也差不多快来了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0018_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_01_1005_049mom", "source_sha256": "9c41356eca5c9f79932756ad9ab933ed256afdfd2245333852f3855fc55bda74", "ja": "へえ。お兄ちゃん、桃子より先に来てるなんて、\nえらいじゃない。これなら少しは褒めてあげても……。", "zh": "哦，大哥哥居然比桃子还要早来，真了不起。\n应该稍微夸奖你一下……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0018_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_01_1006_049mom", "source_sha256": "c4c1498072a8ab26cd450c0fde935991b11a4938e61dc30cf9a95fd61b6ab6c0", "ja": "あ、天海、春香……さん。", "zh": "啊，天海……春香……姊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0018_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_01_1007_001har", "source_sha256": "67d43c3a6aea9f6107bedc4be22e6d1ab3dff9cfcc697e4471323a825f0e918e", "ja": "桃子ちゃん！　今回は、桃子ちゃんとも\n一緒のお仕事なのかな？　よろしくね！", "zh": "桃子！这次的工作是跟桃子一起吗？\n请多指教！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0018_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_01_1008_049mom", "source_sha256": "08bbfc9fc4b5a21deeca6f75e26d91a7052d3140fb393093e89e1e343be1784e", "ja": "よ、よろしく、お願いします……。", "zh": "请、请春香姊……多多指教……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0018_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_01_1009_001har", "source_sha256": "68e6d146a5868928935f9438180211fc3f728438eaffa62a272f36d1dcc9163d", "ja": "敬語じゃなくていいよっ、\n同じ劇場の仲間だもん。ね？", "zh": "不需要这么客气啦，\n我们是同一间剧场的伙伴嘛，对不对？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0018_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_01_1010_049mom", "source_sha256": "5e67d1540aa7f8345a9716f686d8e0e07b060c7ac5f420a3416f65e2588d66b0", "ja": "でも……一応、事務所の先輩、だし……。", "zh": "但是……春香姊好歹也是事务所的前辈……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0018_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_01_1011_001har", "source_sha256": "e11454c3edc6ed2ed25b4fc280503aa65728a8e93fd3a95f3619ec8f23a9f23b", "ja": "あ、でもほら、桃子ちゃんの方が芸能界では先輩だよ！\nですよね、{$P$}さん？", "zh": "啊，不过桃子是演艺圈的前辈呀！\n{$P$}先生，没错吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0018_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_01_1012_p", "source_sha256": "0d411d3b27fa3aa422bafc220b7099285ef37bb31bbbf1175cc04d3cc4899b4b", "ja": "そうだな。春香本人もいいって言ってるんだし、\n桃子、敬語じゃなくていいんじゃないか？", "zh": "对呀，春香自己都说没关系了，\n桃子你就不用这么客气了吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0018_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_01_1013_049mom", "source_sha256": "c91b272ecb7a698edf9397e3826e41fa0d56a2a3484c0615a844c8a90269a266", "ja": "もう、お兄ちゃんは甘いんだから！\nそんなんじゃ、厳しい芸能界じゃ……。", "zh": "真是的，大哥哥你太天真了啦！\n这样在严苛的演艺圈里……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0018_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_01_1014_043nor", "source_sha256": "d1f7abffa9514bdcc96644ff1c6737f3165477d3cc47f68895715ce494c0aae1", "ja": "おはよー！\nあっ、春香に桃子！　もう来てたんだね？", "zh": "早安～！\n啊，春香跟桃子！你们已经到啦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0018_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_01_1015_037nao", "source_sha256": "6e062cc80eec56df06985b4204625a661155b694cb0f690c988f4e65911fc092", "ja": "{$P$}さん、おはようございますー！\nって、桃子に説教されてるん？　何したん？", "zh": "{$P$}先生，早安啊！\n你在被桃子训话吗？你做了什么呀？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0018_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_01_1016_p", "source_sha256": "c43b92597043982d30089db2985c7755d1a705bb85e0f64811aac3de293450db", "ja": "いや、何もしてないぞ。さて、あとは\n亜利沙も呼んでるんだけど……。", "zh": "不，我什么都没做。\n那么，好像只剩亚利沙还没来……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0018_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_01_1017_028ari", "source_sha256": "e65e6704c16254c2beadaef401c7c127fa420f554e2694b38ab7ea87cacc6829", "ja": "うわぁ～んっ！　遅刻遅刻ぅっ！", "zh": "呜哇～！要迟到了、要迟到了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0018_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_01_1018_p", "source_sha256": "035becd5e92ca08aef28f4489df281af68a38deafc9b3d10ed6874c56ecf8059", "ja": "おっと、ぎりぎり待ち合わせ時間には\n間に合ったかな。おはよう、亜利沙。", "zh": "哦，勉强赶上集合时间了呢。\n早啊，亚利沙。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0018_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_01_1019_028ari", "source_sha256": "e947ea19cbbf86de60cab115893f26dda9b108085c2f64755c8683604dd85e91", "ja": "よ、よかったです～。パンをくわえて\n走るのって、意外と難しいものなんですね……。", "zh": "太、太好了～\n咬着面包奔跑其实还满有难度的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0018_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_01_1020_028ari", "source_sha256": "603464451c42f7561e1198ceee66234a8322993ea9fd019970c25ac213d28c1b", "ja": "桃子ちゃんも、気を付けた方がいいですよ！", "zh": "桃子，你在咬着面包跑的时候，也要注意安全喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0018_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_01_1021_049mom", "source_sha256": "9beaf7648d2428d91139caccddfc732b2d93700eecfc7005b48d712f657c52a0", "ja": "え、桃子、そんなことしないし……。", "zh": "呃，桃子又不会做那种事……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0018_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_01_1022_001har", "source_sha256": "55d6bc09a02ad371ffa56eee5c799672882b37c2ac7f8f46a0ebf61e570e190d", "ja": "あ、これで全員そろったんじゃないですか？\n{$P$}さん。", "zh": "啊，{$P$}先生，\n这样是不是所有人都到齐了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0018_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_01_1023_p", "source_sha256": "01a83c0ee4870f3545e951685eebed9861db40b40af69704d459982175cc2cfd", "ja": "よし。じゃあ、さっそくだが聞いてくれ。", "zh": "好，那就事不宜迟，请大家听我说。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0018_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_01_1024_p", "source_sha256": "cef9ef653c729fc9de4b62def88f2b6eb8008e649995e34c35faa5cd80944599", "ja": "今日、みんなに集まってもらったのは、\nこの5人でユニットを組んでもらうからなんだ。", "zh": "今天找大家来，\n是因为要让你们五个人组成团体。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0018_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_01_1025_043nor", "source_sha256": "35770e5d92a69135d4cee871867b042c21d8bc9f5bea539fe08d3feadab3acc3", "ja": "この5人で、ユニット！？", "zh": "让我们五个人组成团体！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0018_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_01_1026_037nao", "source_sha256": "dbe00964bfa18e3354bee925c24c296f742c2f7275e0f198e0369b84e6400b62", "ja": "ユニットって、この前のクレシェンドブルーとか、\n乙女ストームみたいなん！？", "zh": "所谓的团体是像之前的『Crescendo Blue』，\n或是『少女风暴』那样的吼！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0018_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_01_1027_043nor", "source_sha256": "1fec464ff796a5100ec0d8a95af2e1fa20872dad8beb58eaf80a481b94175235", "ja": "だよねだよね！\nどうしよう……アタシ、武者震いしてきた……！", "zh": "对吧对吧！\n怎么办……我都兴奋到颤抖了……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0018_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_01_1028_028ari", "source_sha256": "496f11a8c31473df3c1383418b2ddf5ab7f36b22cbf569f026b8344216d97d7c", "ja": "ユニット……つ、つまりそれは、\nありさが春香さんと、同じユニットに……？", "zh": "团体……也、也就是说，\n亚利沙要跟春香，在同一个团体里……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0018_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_01_1029_028ari", "source_sha256": "6c69a579fb34f72288c3c45e90b20812f17cc0667546486dc763cbaf85236cab", "ja": "も、桃子ちゃん！　ありさの\nほっぺ、ギュッとつねってください！", "zh": "桃、桃子！\n麻烦你用力捏一下亚利沙的脸颊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0018_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_01_1030_049mom", "source_sha256": "aad6683e423ad2149ed1346ea12df301a32000924657204b4318cf0dc1ad517d", "ja": "え、イヤだけど……。", "zh": "咦，桃子才不要……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0018_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_01_1031_028ari", "source_sha256": "fa8028f96cf10007b63c6e386211e44220d4691e7f7df72be779031f965f14fc", "ja": "だって、ありさとあの春香さんが同じユニットだなんて\n夢だとしか思えませんよぉ！？", "zh": "因为亚利沙居然可以跟那个春香同属一个团体，\n这种事情只有在梦中才可能发生吧！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0018_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_01_1032_001har", "source_sha256": "4666a0670277a5ce75c7170255ea7086bf33b490b6c6a64756115f7c0dc17547", "ja": "そ、そんなにヘンかな？　私は亜利沙ちゃんたちと\nユニットが組めるの、とってもうれしいんだけど……。", "zh": "有、有这么奇怪吗？\n可以跟亚利沙你们一起组成团体，我倒是很开心……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0018_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_01_1033_028ari", "source_sha256": "4e9b263b99d66a0b3dffa686c5652c49dab3248d2bdd57d6556fbfae7a71e687", "ja": "ひええ！　ヘ、ヘンとかじゃなくてですね……！\nど、どうしましょう、桃子ちゃん～っ！？", "zh": "呜呀！亚利沙不是觉得奇怪……！\n怎、怎么办，桃子～！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0018_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_01_1034_049mom", "source_sha256": "6a15caa36e8d71e0a2ad501e6c8c563d92297436a9693c8b47b788af18651bd4", "ja": "亜利沙さん、ひとりで勝手に盛り上がらないで。\nお仕事なんだから、ちゃんとして。", "zh": "亚利沙姊，你不要一个人自顾自地兴奋。\n这是工作，请你认真一点。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0018_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_01_1035_028ari", "source_sha256": "82d1f3aad2f0a2ff1b506c6f10bc532ff0b80e0cefe88982ceed2efa2f5c2996", "ja": "は、はひ、すみません……っ。", "zh": "好、好的，对不起……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0018_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_01_1036_043nor", "source_sha256": "07a6f0a9624384c4e669e6d1bb1484eb4786bdb297c00bae48ee3f368c485436", "ja": "まあ、ソワソワしちゃう気持ちもわかるけどね。春香の\n隣で歌うことになるなんて、思ってもみなかったし！", "zh": "没关系啦，我也可以体会你兴奋到坐立不安的心情。\n毕竟从来没想过居然有一天可以站在春香旁边唱歌呀！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0018_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_01_1037_037nao", "source_sha256": "53a1bc23b3b9c72aa57bbeeed6fd8e532033acf7dedd8362c8fde755f654f048", "ja": "せやな～。私も、なんや今から緊張してきたわ。\n気合い入れていかんとな！", "zh": "嘿呀～我现在也突然紧张起来啦。\n必须好好加油才行啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0018_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_01_1038_037nao", "source_sha256": "95ee4a789cb998eb8f4319fa5d35d1b6e932184a14909a5fe95bfbd79453f50f", "ja": "あ、{$P$}さん。\nこのユニットのリーダーはやっぱり……？", "zh": "啊，{$P$}先生。\n这个团体的队长应该就是……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0018_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_01_1039_p", "source_sha256": "3f906f4e69d39426d824c722be6a4764cd837a49e56290a90790c567c4e5e61d", "ja": "ああ。この5人のユニット、『リコッタ』のリーダーは\n春香だ。みんなのまとめ役、よろしく頼んだぞ。", "zh": "嗯，这个五人团体『Ricotta』的队长就是春香。\n带领大家的工作就交给你啰。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0018_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_01_1040_001har", "source_sha256": "b96ee1770efcac2415fb6faddeb8091bac6f9ad0a424b8e9dbec9c44da9261ae", "ja": "へぇ、リコッタっていうんですね！　カワイイな～♪\n……えっ？　私がリーダーですか！？", "zh": "哇，原来团体名称叫做『Ricotta』吗！好可爱喔～♪\n……咦？队长是我吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0018_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_01_1041_043nor", "source_sha256": "4125a96dd30fc8ca228999509c96bbb8959dc395b7ff58ecb502648acec50d21", "ja": "なーに言ってんの！\n春香しかいないって！", "zh": "你在说什么呀！\n除了春香还能是谁呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0018_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_01_1042_037nao", "source_sha256": "fedd70655ad961274c4f8c98687110636597fffaf1b9d768f61a9a8994017663", "ja": "うんうん。奈緒がリーダーだ！ってボケられたら\nどないしよかと思てたけど、ひと安心やな♪", "zh": "嗯嗯，我本来还担心要是被开玩笑说「队长是奈绪！」\n该怎么吐槽咧，这样我就放心啦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0018_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_01_1043_049mom", "source_sha256": "546d3b65fa16a7f168a6308c4e725c97dc40fd16a4dacd598af1b12f15fa3e18", "ja": "じゃあ、春香さん。よろしくお願いしま……。\nあの、よろしくね。", "zh": "那么，就请春香姊……\n那个，请你多多指教。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0018_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_01_1044_028ari", "source_sha256": "4fcc6cd204d29303423a86b0f0b8caafce4f3e4d64fdc37ee871718a6f3cb28f", "ja": "よろしくお願いします！\nよろしくお願いしますぅ！", "zh": "请多多指教！\n请多多指教～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0018_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_01_1045_001har", "source_sha256": "83f90d74d472f109164970e2cbe261232ae76929eef836489265829f661814d1", "ja": "も、もう……。\nでも、ありがとう、みんな！", "zh": "真、真是的……\n不过还是谢谢大家！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0018_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_01_1046_001har", "source_sha256": "a0ae3def1f0f8d53770b1aeeb6d882cbc4609a6068fe61a8fe0818583795fe54", "ja": "えっと……。私、みんなをぐいぐい引っぱって！\nみたいなのは、あんまり得意じゃないから……。", "zh": "那个……\n我不太擅长像火车头一样，用力拉着大家前进……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0018_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_01_1047_001har", "source_sha256": "640c92687ee9484639cbd4aadd5bea675c33f8ca676d0968b7e7f379ba8c0e17", "ja": "お互いに助け合って、笑いあって進めるような……\nそんな『リコッタ』に、みんなでなろうね！", "zh": "所以就让我们成为……\n大家彼此帮助，一起笑着前进的『Ricotta』吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0018_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_01_1048_049mom", "source_sha256": "b96bdef1da1baed37785b5d34cd69d3ebf0727a310e843be161a905b96889201", "ja": "はいっ！", "zh": "好的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
